COMPILATION OF: E52VC

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52VC

   1 a 0000 E52VC: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-9 probe VC (PLAN sec P3-9 H2 DISCRIMINATOR):
   4 a 0006       the 91 operands SWAPPED. SN => head 2A, region identical
   5 a 0006       to VB; RB (right-first) => head 3A (LDA emitted first).
   6 a 0006       The head byte decides the fold-order law. */
   7 a 0006 
   8 c 0006    dcl dl fixed binary;
   9 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  10 c 0006 
  11 c 0006    if dl > 2 | dl < 0 then x = 1;
  12 c 001D    x = 2;
  13 c 0023 
  14 a 0023 end E52VC;

CODE SIZE = 0026
DATA AREA = 0004
FREE SYMS = 38AF
END  COMPILATION
